I en kin diar ei wasahn ruk oh meleilei pahn mwetehn nin limomwi.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Maing Koht, komw ketin karongeier ei tungoal inou kan","poem":1},{"text":"oh ketikihongieier dahme en irail kan me kin waunekin komwi.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Komw ketin kareireila mour en nanmwarkio;","poem":1},{"text":"komw kupwure pwe en kin momour kohkohlahte!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Maing Koht, nanmwarkio en kin kakaun mwohn silangmwi kohkohlahte;","poem":1},{"text":"komw ketin kasilehki sapwellimomwi limpoak poatopoat oh loalopwoat.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Eri, I pahn patohwan koulkihong komwi koulen kaping ahnsou koaros,","poem":1},{"text":"ni ei pahn kin patohwan meirongkihong komwi rahn koaros dahme I inoukidahr.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pon_ssp/PSA/61.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pon_ssp/PSA/62.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pon_ssp/PSA/60.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}